@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title VM scan과 함께 준비되는 after_event tracker
participant "런타임 호스트\n(ControlRuntime)" as Host
participant "Rust AfterEventRuntime\n(WASM)" as AE
participant "Rust VM" as VM
Host -> AE : 명시적 event fact와\nmeasured 술어 관측 준비
AE --> Host : Rust 소유 any/all 결과
Host -> VM : 결과를 private 생성\nResult 입력에 담아 scan
alt VM scan 확정
  VM --> Host : committed
  Host -> AE : tracker 상태 commit
else VM scan 거부
  VM --> Host : rejected
  Host -> AE : tracker 상태 rollback
end
@enduml
